<title>GERMANY: Thyssen says to sell RWK to Lhoist.</title>
<headline>Thyssen says to sell RWK to Lhoist.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German diversified industrial group Thyssen AG said on Friday it would sell its remaining 50.1 percent stake in Rheinische Kalkskteinwerke GmbH to the Lhoist Group, a Belgian minerals processor.</p>
<p>The sale is to take effect on February 1. Thyssen already sold a 24.9 percent stake to Lhoist on September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Terence Gallagher, Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
